SessionScan

This project adapts information architecture (channel tabs, search-over-cards,
job/video/forum lists) and the daily scrape / keep-yesterday / yt-dlp / Bahamut
/ X syndication pipeline from https://github.com/franky5440-afk/poe2
(Apache License 2.0).

Modifications:
- Visual design (vice-dusk skin), Traditional Chinese copy, and sample data
  are original SessionScan work and are not from that project.
- scraper.py / build_site.py / .github/workflows/daily.yml retarget Frank's
  PoE 2 data pipeline to GTA 5, GTA Online, RDO, and GTA 6 (no GTA 4).
- Money/jobs cards are outbound titles, links, and dates from GTABase, IGN,
  and GTA Wiki only — full guides are never reprinted.
- SessionScan's own YouTube slot stays a placeholder when the channel is
  offline; no SessionScan video URLs are fabricated.
- Thumbnails are not stored; the site hotlinks YouTube i.ytimg.com.

